{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And he shall judge the poor with righteousness.</b> Like the laws of the Torah, that one shall not show partiality to the poor (Exodus 23:3)." "<b>And he shall reprove with equity.</b> The good." "<b>And he shall strike the earth.</b> With his mouth, as though it were a rod against the wicked."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 11, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:21.506115012Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}